  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1101.02 “Building official” means the code enforcement or other designated authority charged with the administration and enforcement of the building code, or a duly authorized representative.\n\nSource. #10011, eff 10-19-11; ss by #10137, eff 5-23-12, EXPIRED: 5-23-22\n\nNew. #13418, eff 7-25-22",
